{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "title": "KNX/DALI gateway: groups, dimming, and faults",
  "description": "A short press switches the light on or off; a long press dims it using DPT 3.007 until release. The gateway translates each telegram into a DALI command for its two groups: office (ballasts A0–A3) and corridor (A4–A5). Click a luminaire to simulate a ballast fault; the gateway detects it on its next poll and reports it on 1/7/x. Use the USB interface panel to write group address 1/1/0, which the gateway maps to a DALI broadcast command, or to read statuses and faults.",
